{
  "id": "a2-polynomials-04",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Complex numbers",
  "xp": 18,
  "tags": [
    "algebra",
    "complex"
  ],
  "learn": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "kind": "text",
      "title": "A number for $\\sqrt{-1}$",
      "body": "No real number squares to $-1$, so we define one: $i=\\sqrt{-1}$, with $i^2=-1$. A complex number looks like $a+bi$, with a real part $a$ and an imaginary part $b$. For example $\\sqrt{-9}=3i$."
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "kind": "example",
      "title": "Add and multiply",
      "body": "Treat $i$ like a variable, then replace $i^2$ with $-1$.",
      "steps": [
        "$(3+2i)+(1-4i)=4-2i$",
        "$(2+3i)(1-i)=2-2i+3i-3i^2$",
        "$i^2=-1$, so $-3i^2=+3$",
        "Total: $5+i$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "kind": "text",
      "title": "Conjugates and division",
      "body": "The conjugate of $a+bi$ is $a-bi$. Multiplying them gives a real number: $(3+2i)(3-2i)=9+4=13$. To divide, multiply top and bottom by the conjugate of the bottom. The modulus $|a+bi|=\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}$ is the distance from 0, so $|3+4i|=5$."
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "kind": "tip",
      "body": "Powers of $i$ repeat every 4: $i,\\ -1,\\ -i,\\ 1$. Divide the exponent by 4 and use the remainder."
    }
  ],
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "prompt": "What is $\\sqrt{-25}$?",
      "choices": [
        "$-5$",
        "$25i$",
        "$5i$"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 2,
      "explanation": "$\\sqrt{-25}=\\sqrt{25}\\cdot\\sqrt{-1}=5i$."
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "prompt": "What is $(3+2i)+(1-4i)$?",
      "choices": [
        "$4+6i$",
        "$4-2i$",
        "$2-2i$"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 1,
      "explanation": "Add the real parts $3+1=4$ and the imaginary parts $2-4=-2$."
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "prompt": "What is $(2+3i)(1-i)$?",
      "choices": [
        "$5+i$",
        "$-1+i$",
        "$2-3i$"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 0,
      "explanation": "$2-2i+3i-3i^2=2+i+3=5+i$."
    },
    {
      "id": "q4",
      "type": "type_answer",
      "prompt": "$i^{10}=$ ?",
      "accepted": [
        "-1",
        "−1"
      ],
      "keypad": "numeric",
      "explanation": "10 divided by 4 leaves remainder 2, and $i^2=-1$."
    },
    {
      "id": "q5",
      "type": "type_answer",
      "prompt": "$(4+i)(4-i)=$ ?",
      "accepted": [
        "17"
      ],
      "keypad": "numeric",
      "explanation": "A number times its conjugate is $a^2+b^2=16+1=17$."
    },
    {
      "id": "q6",
      "type": "type_answer",
      "prompt": "$|6+8i|=$ ?",
      "accepted": [
        "10"
      ],
      "keypad": "numeric",
      "explanation": "$\\sqrt{36+64}=\\sqrt{100}=10$."
    },
    {
      "id": "q7",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "prompt": "What is $i^{27}$?",
      "choices": [
        "$i$",
        "$-1$",
        "$-i$"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 2,
      "explanation": "27 leaves remainder 3 when divided by 4, and $i^3=-i$."
    },
    {
      "id": "q8",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "prompt": "What is $\\frac{1+2i}{3-i}$?",
      "choices": [
        "$\\frac{1-7i}{10}$",
        "$\\frac{1+7i}{10}$",
        "$\\frac{3+2i}{4}$"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 1,
      "explanation": "Multiply top and bottom by $3+i$: top $1+7i$, bottom $9+1=10$."
    }
  ]
}